1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 29]</font>

15
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

16
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this whole world, besides you,</font>

17
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's no better girl than me.</font>

18
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For your brother's happiness,</font>

19
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have to help me out, right?</font>

20
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:30,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

21
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, help me out.</font>

22
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

23
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying.</font>

24
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:41,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My stomach hurts.</font>

25
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to use the outhouse.</font>

26
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll find you later.</font>

27
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:57,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

28
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why were you in my study?</font>

29
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No reason.</font>

30
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hand it over.</font>

31
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, what do you mean?</font>

32
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What thing?</font>

33
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:09,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You took something
from the secret compartment.</font>

34
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The steward told me everything.</font>

35
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan.</font>

36
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to me.</font>

37
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That thing is not for you to touch.</font>

38
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It burrows into flesh
at the sight of blood.</font>

39
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's very dangerous.</font>

40
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

41
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard everything.</font>

42
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You orchestrated the massacre
of the Qin family</font>

43
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Prince Duan's family.</font>

44
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You even planned to use the banquet</font>

45
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to kill Prince Duan.</font>

46
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Never plot to harm others
for your own gain."</font>

47
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Never covet petty advantages."</font>

48
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Serve the country with loyalty,
treat friends with sincerity."</font>

49
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You taught me these,</font>

50
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">guiding my hand
as I learned each character.</font>

51
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you live by those words yourself?</font>

52
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you been putting
on an act all along?</font>

53
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You worthless disgrace.</font>

54
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you understand what this signifies?</font>

55
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan's family
outshone the sovereign.</font>

56
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Qin family held military authority.</font>

57
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once they joined forces,</font>

58
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">chaos would surely consume the land.</font>

59
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For the sake of Beiyuan,</font>

60
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had no other choice.</font>

61
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hand it over.</font>

62
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

63
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give it to me.</font>

64
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:05,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said no.</font>

65
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:10,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Better to kill wrongly than let go.</font>

66
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this how you love our country?</font>

67
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, calm yourself.</font>

68
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:15,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay back.</font>

69
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know how swift my blade is.</font>

70
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin.</font>

71
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you want?</font>

72
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

73
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:27,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me that censer.</font>

74
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. Take it.</font>

75
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put the knife down first.</font>

76
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:31,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't give it to her.</font>

77
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She wouldn't dare kill me.</font>

78
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

79
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already died once.</font>

80
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is there to fear?</font>

81
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:44,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give it to me.</font>

82
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You unfilial brat!</font>

83
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you dare give it to her,</font>

84
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even if I die today,</font>

85
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will not rest in peace.</font>

86
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:52,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

87
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know my father wronged your family.</font>

88
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you know how Jiang Ying and I</font>

89
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have treated you.</font>

90
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I apologize on my father's behalf.</font>

91
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for whatever punishment</font>

92
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my family deserves,</font>

93
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let the law decide.</font>

94
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

95
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg you.</font>

96
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't hurt my father.</font>

97
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

98
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with what happened today,</font>

99
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had no other choice.</font>

100
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you must blame me,</font>

101
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let's pretend</font>

102
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we never knew each other.</font>

103
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master!</font>

104
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan, run!</font>

105
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Destroy the catalyst!</font>

106
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

107
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry I'm late.</font>

108
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got the catalyst.</font>

109
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo!</font>

110
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, watch out!</font>

111
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">While I still have some reason left,</font>

112
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get out of my sight!</font>

113
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:12,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan!</font>

114
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:13,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief!</font>

115
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I took this strike</font>

116
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for my father.</font>

117
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan,</font>

118
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you once saved me.</font>

119
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

120
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This time,</font>

121
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not too late, right?</font>

122
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will remember</font>

123
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this favor.</font>

124
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan.</font>

125
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I keep my word.</font>

126
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By sparing Duke Dingguo today,</font>

127
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:46,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am repaying your kindness.</font>

128
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

129
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Qin and Li families</font>

130
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will be avenged sooner or later.</font>

131
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:56,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

132
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whoever dares to stop me</font>

133
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dies.</font>

134
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

135
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan.</font>

136
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan.</font>

137
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan, how did you get hurt?</font>

138
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:23,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

139
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let them go.</font>

140
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:30,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let them go!</font>

141
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:32,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

142
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what happened to Miss Qin?</font>

143
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The antidote has entered her system.</font>

144
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go check on her.</font>

145
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is she?</font>

146
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:57,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry, Your Highness.</font>

147
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Judging by her pulse,</font>

148
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:02,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin is in a stable condition.</font>

149
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her vital energy and blood</font>

150
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">seem even stronger than before.</font>

151
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stable?</font>

152
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Bloodlure Poison is so potent.</font>

153
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:10,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The catalyst is inside her.</font>

154
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has it truly had no effect?</font>

155
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Examine her more carefully.</font>

156
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though the catalyst entered her body,</font>

157
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">legend has it</font>

158
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the catalyst can control
the Bloodlure Poison.</font>

159
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Judging from Miss Qin's condition,</font>

160
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there should be no immediate danger.</font>

161
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The catalyst controls
the Bloodlure Poison?</font>

162
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean? Explain clearly.</font>

163
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as Miss Qin is safe,</font>

164
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you will also be safe.</font>

165
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And vice versa.</font>

166
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:42,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If something happens to me,</font>

167
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will you be implicated too?</font>

168
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't matter.</font>

169
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now,</font>

170
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:51,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we share life and death,</font>

171
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bound together as one.</font>

172
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physician,</font>

173
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">quickly, check her wound.</font>

174
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

175
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:05,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did the wound vanish?</font>

176
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:06,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My hand...</font>

177
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The wound is gone?</font>

178
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

179
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're injured too?</font>

180
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:24,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

181
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you feel a sharp pain in your palm,</font>

182
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as if pierced by a blade?</font>

183
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is this happening?</font>

184
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As Mr. Qin once said,</font>

185
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Bloodlure Poison is
a rare poison of Xizhao.</font>

186
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once the antidote enters the body,</font>

187
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it interacts with the poisoned person.</font>

188
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin's injuries</font>

189
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">heal on their own,</font>

190
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while you feel weak all over.</font>

191
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must be because the poison
in your body</font>

192
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the antidote in Miss Qin's body</font>

193
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are now linked.</font>

194
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never imagined</font>

195
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this poison could be so remarkable.</font>

196
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It can actually create</font>

197
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:00,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a shared sense of pain.</font>

198
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does that mean</font>

199
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">any injury I suffer in the future</font>

200
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:07,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will affect the Prince as well?</font>

201
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't even fear death for me,</font>

202
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so this small wound is nothing.</font>

203
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:29,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

204
00:11:30,280 --> 00:11:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan acted wildly yesterday,</font>

205
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:33,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wreaking havoc
at Duke Dingguo's Mansion.</font>

206
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He disturbed the guests,</font>

207
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and today, he skipped
morning court unexcused.</font>

208
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such a lack of decorum,</font>

209
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if not severely punished,</font>

210
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">may lead to greater insolence.</font>

211
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I second the motion.</font>

212
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In recent years, Prince Duan
has used his illness as a shield,</font>

213
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:47,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">behaving erratically</font>

214
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and acting on every whim.</font>

215
00:11:48,920 --> 00:11:50,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He shows none of the bearing expected</font>

216
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of a court official or imperial kinsman.</font>

217
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two are being too harsh.</font>

218
00:11:58,280 --> 00:11:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yesterday,</font>

219
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:01,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan simply had
a few too many drinks</font>

220
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and lost his sense of measure.</font>

221
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But yesterday's birthday banquet</font>

222
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:06,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was just a family gathering for me.</font>

223
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There were no court officials present,</font>

224
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so there's no need
to make it a state affair.</font>

225
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since</font>

226
00:12:12,400 --> 00:12:13,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo has said as much,</font>

227
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:15,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">both of you, put aside your anger.</font>

228
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan is seriously ill</font>

229
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and should not overexert himself.</font>

230
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You all serve the same court.</font>

231
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should show
each other consideration.</font>

232
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

233
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:27,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are dismissed.</font>

234
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">More medicine?</font>

235
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:43,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This isn't medicine.</font>

236
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:45,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's Ten-Ingredient Tonic Soup.</font>

237
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I added Codonopsis root,
deer antler velvet,</font>

238
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chinese angelica, Fo-ti...</font>

239
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop.</font>

240
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:50,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

241
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:53,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm practically a herb in that pot.</font>

242
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What herb?</font>

243
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chinese angelica.</font>

244
00:12:59,520 --> 00:13:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is time for me to leave.</font>

245
00:13:03,520 --> 00:13:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The antidote is within me.</font>

246
00:13:05,160 --> 00:13:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I were to get hurt,</font>

247
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even if it's just a minor scrape,</font>

248
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it could endanger you.</font>

249
00:13:09,920 --> 00:13:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is just a precaution.</font>

250
00:13:13,680 --> 00:13:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're worrying over nothing.</font>

251
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:19,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

252
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my body</font>

253
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not as fragile as you think.</font>

254
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop worrying about me.</font>

255
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am just concerned about you.</font>

256
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

257
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A eunuch from the Palace sent a message.</font>

258
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty summons you</font>

259
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to discuss an urgent matter.</font>

260
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am not going.</font>

261
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say the Prince is unwell.</font>

262
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:43,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He cannot go.</font>

263
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

264
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

265
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's sent many summons
for you to attend court.</font>

266
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he truly ordered</font>

267
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what happened back then,</font>

268
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what do you plan to do?</font>

269
00:14:04,560 --> 00:14:05,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For all they owe us,</font>

270
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:08,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will make them repay every last debt.</font>

271
00:14:31,400 --> 00:14:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is Meng Xi still kneeling outside?</font>

272
00:14:32,800 --> 00:14:34,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I tried to persuade him.</font>

273
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">General Meng refuses to leave,</font>

274
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">saying he insists you reopen the case</font>

275
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of the murder of General Li's family</font>

276
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on behalf of the border forces.</font>

277
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:43,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

278
00:14:43,800 --> 00:14:44,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">conflict has erupted at the frontier.</font>

279
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Yangming Army stirred up trouble,</font>

280
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">clashing with our border patrol troops.</font>

281
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some soldiers are wounded.</font>

282
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The situation is at a stalemate.</font>

283
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We await your judgment.</font>

284
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:55,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

285
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Yangming Army stationed in Guanzhou,</font>

286
00:14:57,280 --> 00:14:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on the grounds of unpaid wages,</font>

287
00:14:58,680 --> 00:14:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has surrounded the government granary.</font>

288
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Magistrate of Guanzhou can't resist.</font>

289
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He awaits your judgment.</font>

290
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:05,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Yangming Army.</font>

291
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Yangming Army again.</font>

292
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They've mutinied.</font>

293
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of them have turned against me.</font>

294
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Prince Duan?</font>

295
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

296
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan is unwell
and cannot attend court.</font>

297
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Unwell?</font>

298
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is outrageous!</font>

299
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is clearly forcing my hand.</font>

300
00:15:27,760 --> 00:15:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep summoning him</font>

301
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:30,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">until he comes!</font>

302
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As you command.</font>

303
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go, now.</font>

304
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mutiny.</font>

305
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A complete mutiny.</font>

306
00:15:53,040 --> 00:15:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My victory is assured.</font>

307
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The game is not over yet.</font>

308
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who wins and who loses</font>

309
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:58,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">remains to be seen.</font>

310
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

311
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:02,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The messenger eunuch</font>

312
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has been waiting
at the gate for four hours.</font>

313
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:05,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shall we send him away?</font>

314
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

315
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have no way out.</font>

316
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:10,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Surrender now.</font>

317
00:16:20,560 --> 00:16:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

318
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Defeat has turned to victory.</font>

319
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

320
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you lost</font>

321
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:27,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because you wanted to win too badly,</font>

322
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:28,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">pressing me at every turn.</font>

323
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What you didn't expect</font>

324
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is that I can turn defense into offense.</font>

325
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See? You lost.</font>

326
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dull.</font>

327
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:41,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed, it is dull.</font>

328
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should seek out something interesting.</font>

329
00:16:45,800 --> 00:16:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

330
00:16:48,670 --> 00:16:50,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

331
00:16:50,340 --> 00:16:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

332
00:16:54,260 --> 00:16:58,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

333
00:16:58,940 --> 00:17:02,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

334
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:07,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

335
00:17:07,450 --> 00:17:11,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

336
00:17:11,780 --> 00:17:17,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

337
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:24,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

338
00:17:24,590 --> 00:17:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

339
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

340
00:17:33,180 --> 00:17:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

341
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:41,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

342
00:17:41,760 --> 00:17:45,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
